{"id":841809,"title":"09｜Rules for AI","content":"本节课介绍了AI配置中的rules for AI设置，主要应用于所有chat、composer及内嵌对话框模式。默认规则设定为返回中文信息，确保每次会话以中文响应。全局规则可配置多条，如应答格式、代码生成规则等，例如函数名首字母大写且不含下划线。配置界面自动保存设置，除全局规则外，还支持项目级规则通过cos rules文件配置，项目规则优先级高于全局规则。若不确定如何编写规则，可利用composer自动生成constr rulers文件，并根据需求描述自定义规则。生成的文件包含忽略路径和代码风格规范等内容，如缩进使用四个空格、引号必须双引号等。对于难以理解的部分，可通过chat获取解释。规则配置需根据个人编码习惯与项目需求逐步完善，无固定标准。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":402677,"user_name":"Geek_jg3r26","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1454691,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"7D093ED7273CBE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/0.png","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1759053373,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146386,"content":"是的，配置界面相比课程录制时发生了变化。现在拆分成了User Rules和Project Rules。\nUser Rules是填写全局通用的规则，比如AI应答时使用的语言。\nProject Rules是在项目的.cursor&#47;rules目录下创建一个后缀名为mdc的规则文件。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1759236798,"ip_address":"河北","comment_id":402677,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"现在版本没有Rules for ai， 是Rules &amp; Memories。 是在User Rules还是在Project Rules添加呢","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":672253,"discussion_content":"是的，配置界面相比课程录制时发生了变化。现在拆分成了User Rules和Project Rules。\nUser Rules是填写全局通用的规则，比如AI应答时使用的语言。\nProject Rules是在项目的.cursor/rules目录下创建一个后缀名为mdc的规则文件。","content_length":282,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1759236798,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"河北","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_numbe